       1. Header & Navigation: Sticky header with system overview badge, navigation tabs corresponding to logical analysis topics rather than rigid report chapters (Overview/Simulator, Inference Engines, Detection & Quantization, LPR OCR, Super-Resolution, Korean Rules & Regex Engine).
       2. Tab 1 - Overview & Pipeline Simulator: Interactive end-to-end ANPR Pipeline simulator where users can change optical conditions (Low Light, High Speed, Low Res) and see live pipeline state updates, metrics, and step-by-step logic.
       3. Tab 2 - Inference Engine Benchmark: Interactive comparison between OpenCV 5 DNN and ONNX Runtime / TensorRT across CPU vs GPU environments, operator coverage, and zero-dependency edge benefits.
       4. Tab 3 - Object Detection & INT8 Quantization: Detailed benchmark chart and interactive calculator comparing PyTorch FP32, TensorRT FP16, and TensorRT INT8 on Jetson Orin NX and Raspberry Pi 5.
       5. Tab 4 - LPR OCR Engine Comparison: LPRNet (CTC+STN) vs PP-OCRv4 Mobile side-by-side comparison matrix and dynamic performance trade-off chart.
       6. Tab 5 - Image Enhancement & Super-Resolution: CLAHE/Retinex vs Real-ESRGAN quality metrics (PSNR, SSIM) with live simulated image comparison tool and OCR accuracy impact analysis.
       7. Tab 6 - Korean License Plate & Regex Post-Processing: Interactive Regex Validator tool for Korean license plate formats (8-digit, 7-digit, electric, commercial) allowing real-time input testing and auto-correction.
  -->
