       - Pipeline Interactive Visual Simulator -> Dynamic HTML/CSS pipeline cards with JS state -> User selects weather/speed pre-set -> Explains active modules & Latency budget.
       - Korean License Plate Regex Tester -> Interactive JS string parsing & matrix logic -> Real-time typing feedback with positional error correction -> Demonstrates post-processing reliability.
       - CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used.
  -->
  <!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->
